; layouts/monthly — one file per month.
;
; The months are spelled out rather than numbered, so **alphabetical order is
; not date order**: february, january, march by name; january, february, march
; by content. A ranking that sorted ids would answer february first. The right
; answer is march, because march holds the newest transaction.

